WEBVTT

00:00:00.902 --> 00:00:01.432
Here is how I would

00:00:01.472 --> 00:00:03.092
answer, tell me about yourself,

00:00:03.132 --> 00:00:04.252
for Acme Corp.

00:00:05.343 --> 00:00:06.212
Right now I'm a Senior

00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:08.222
AI Engineer at Sampletown Software.

00:00:08.262 --> 00:00:09.252
I lead the retrieval

00:00:09.302 --> 00:00:11.582
platform behind our support assistant.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.710
I built the evaluation suite

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.430
that checks each answer against

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.706
its sources.

00:00:16.746 --> 00:00:18.030
It runs 400 fixed questions

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:19.160
every night.

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:21.261
Acme Corp's assistant has to

00:00:21.301 --> 00:00:22.671
cite clinic policies.

00:00:22.711 --> 00:00:23.451
That is the work I

00:00:23.491 --> 00:00:24.581
do today.

00:00:25.565 --> 00:00:26.437
So that's why I applied.

00:00:26.477 --> 00:00:27.207
I want to build an

00:00:27.247 --> 00:00:28.727
assistant people can trust.

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:29.325
Thanks

00:00:29.365 --> 00:00:30.437
for listening.

